    "refereed": true,
    "abstracts": [
      {
        "value": "A renormalization group strategy for the study of bound states in field theory is developed. Our analysis is completely different from conventional analyses, based upon the Bethe-Salpeter equation, and it is far simpler. This is illustrated in state-of-the-art calculations for the ground state splittings in muonium and positronium.",
        "source": "Elsevier"
      }
